From 1e7cb593abc27823e5051e0fa9d5f56dd4de88e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:36:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sim): simulate cylinder stock along X or Y

Build analytic vertical sections for laid cylinders. Use the rounded
underside for carried stock and limit removal to the initial material.
Keep raw cut depths for the existing gouge checks.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2758
